{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And you shall bind</b> Two times in the Masorah: וצרת הכסף בידך and וצרת אותם בכנפיך. And this is what we learned: He who deposits coins with his fellow, and he bound them and slung them behind him, is liable. And the reason is explicated: Scripture says, וצרת הכסף בידך — even though they are bound, they shall be in your hand. And this is: even though וצרת אותם בכנפיך, they shall be in your hand."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:43.848399668Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}